# ==============================================================================
# Frame Talk: Environment Secrets
# Secrets must NOT have fallbacks. Define these in your local .env file.
# Non-secret configurations (domains, quotas, models) are managed in config.json.
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Google Gemini Multimodal & Speech Synthesis API Key (Required for Hosted Demo)
# Free key available at https://aistudio.google.com/
GOOGLE_API_KEY=AIzaSy...

# 2. HMAC Session Secret Key (Required for User ID Cryptographic Verification)
# Used to sign client session tokens and prevent random Sybil attack quota drains.
SESSION_SECRET_KEY=your_secure_random_hmac_secret_key_here

# 3. Google Cloud Flow Key (Optional)
# GCP_FLOW_KEY=AQ.Ab8...
